OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACut National Insurance for under-25s to
OL,4,Acreate jobs, Milburn report to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder Sir Keir Starmer, the government
OL,7,Fraised NI for firms. Milburn will say
OL,8,Fthe number of young people not in
OL,9,Femployment, education or training -
OL,10,Fknown as Neets - was not started by the
OL,11,FNI rise.
OL,13,FBut shadow work and pensions secretary,
OL,14,FHelen Whately, said the government
OL,15,Fshould "just stop doing the taxing".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
