OL,3,AUK will have 'voice' but no vote on EU
OL,4,Afood rules in Brexit reset
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reset would not involve any upfront
OL,7,Fpayments, Falconer added, but made it
OL,8,Fclear there could well be an "exit
OL,9,Fclause" in case a future UK government
OL,10,Freversed the closer alignment.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
