OL,3,AYemeni forces' retreat leaves Houthis
OL,4,Ain control of key Red Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shift ends a weeks-long offensive
OL,7,Fto try to secure the area near the
OL,8,Fwaterway after the Houthis seized it in
OL,9,Fa surprise offensive in September,
OL,10,Fsqueezing global oil exports and
OL,11,Fprompting thousands to flee.
OL,13,FHouthi-run media reported later on
OL,14,FSunday the group had taken control of
OL,15,Fthe territory. Saudi Arabia has not
OL,16,Fcommented.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
